{"seq":2,"slug":"split-optimization-solver","title":"拆单优化求解与降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-optimization/split-optimization-solver","wordCount":2208,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"拆单优化求解与降级\">拆单优化求解与降级</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-这是一个装箱问题-而装箱问题没有多项式精确解\">核心概念：这是一个装箱问题，而装箱问题没有多项式精确解</h2><p>目标函数定好之后，剩下的问题是「在候选拆法里找到使目标最小的那个」。候选拆法的数量随行项数与仓数组合爆炸——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个行项分配到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个仓，理论上限是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种分配，即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=10, m=4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 也是百万量级。更糟的是，这个问题的核心子结构是<strong>装箱问题</strong>（bin packing：用最少的箱子装下给定物品），而装箱的优化形式是 NP-hard 的，其判定形式是强 NP-complete（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bin_packing_problem\">Bin packing problem</a>）。这意味着「找一个保证最优的多项式算法」不存在，除非 P=NP。</p>\n<p>因此工程上的正确问题不是「用什么算法求最优」，而是<strong>分层策略</strong>：在可接受的时间预算内，尽可能拿到好解；拿不到时，退到一个一定可行、虽然不是最优的解。这一篇给出这个降级链的每一层、各层的适用规模与保证，以及超时处理的实现细节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选拆法生成] --&gt; B{规模判定}&#10;  B --&gt;|行项≤8, 仓≤4| C[层1: 精确枚举/CP-SAT]&#10;  B --&gt;|中等| D[层2: 启发式&lt;br/&gt;FFD / 贪心+局部搜索]&#10;  B --&gt;|超时或异常| E[层3: 确定性兜底&lt;br/&gt;按仓就近顺序]&#10;  C --&gt; F{在预算内找到解?}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[返回最优解 + 证明gap]&#10;  F --&gt;|否, 超时| D&#10;  D --&gt; H{可行?}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[返回可行解 + 标记启发式]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| E&#10;  E --&gt; J[返回永远可行解 + 告警]\">graph TD\n  A[候选拆法生成] --&gt; B{规模判定}\n  B --&gt;|行项≤8, 仓≤4| C[层1: 精确枚举/CP-SAT]\n  B --&gt;|中等| D[层2: 启发式&lt;br/&gt;FFD / 贪心+局部搜索]\n  B --&gt;|超时或异常| E[层3: 确定性兜底&lt;br/&gt;按仓就近顺序]\n  C --&gt; F{在预算内找到解?}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[返回最优解 + 证明gap]\n  F --&gt;|否, 超时| D\n  D --&gt; H{可行?}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[返回可行解 + 标记启发式]\n  H --&gt;|否| E\n  E --&gt; J[返回永远可行解 + 告警]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么这个问题是-np-hard\">为什么这个问题是 NP-hard</h2><h3 id=\"归约关系\">归约关系</h3><p>把拆单问题简化到最小形式：忽略时效与附加费，只看「用最少的包裹装下所有行项，每个包裹的总计费重不超过承运商上限」。这就是标准的装箱问题——物品是行项，箱子的容量是重量上限，目标是最小化箱子数。因为存在这个多项式归约（拆单 → 装箱），而装箱是 NP-hard，拆单的优化形式也是 NP-hard。</p>\n<p>认清这一点带来两个实用的推论。第一，<strong>不要期待一个「正确的算法」</strong>，要设计降级链。第二，装箱问题的近似算法结论可以直接借用：<strong>First-Fit Decreasing（FFD）</strong> 的紧界是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>FFD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mtext>OPT</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FFD}(I) \\le \\frac{11}{9}\\,\\text{OPT}(I) + \\frac{6}{9}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FFD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OPT</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即渐近近似比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.222</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11/9 \\approx 1.222</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11/9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.222</span></span></span></span></span>（来源同上）。也就是说，一个几行代码的贪心算法在包裹数上最多比最优差 22%，而在真实订单的行项规模（通常 1–10 件）下，实际差距远小于这个上界。这是「启发式完全够用」的数学依据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"目标里还有背包的影子\">目标里还有背包的影子</h3><p>如果目标不是「用最少的包裹」而是在「包裹数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>」的前提下最小化成本，问题结构就带上<strong>多背包问题</strong>（multiple knapsack）的成分：把行项分配到若干容量受限的包裹里使总成本最小，其中每个包裹的成本函数是非线性的阶梯函数。多背包问题与「把多个背包视为一个容量相加的大背包」<strong>不等价</strong>，这个区别在费率阶梯存在时尤其重要。0-1 背包的标准动态规划 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m[i,w] = \\max(m[i-1,w], m[i-1,w-w_i] + v_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 及其 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nW)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">nW</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度是伪多项式的——因为输入规模取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Knapsack_problem\">Knapsack problem</a>）。这解释了为什么不能指望 DP 在小规模上「总是够快」：当容量以分为单位表示金额时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 会膨胀到百万量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"降级链的三层设计\">降级链的三层设计</h2><h3 id=\"层-1-精确求解\">层 1：精确求解</h3><p>适用条件是<strong>候选空间小且结构清晰</strong>：行项数不超过约 8、候选仓不超过 4，此时枚举所有分配是可行的（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>65</mn><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^8 \\approx 65K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 种，每种评估一次成本即可）。实现上用约束编程 / SAT 求解器（如 OR-Tools 的 CP-SAT）比手写枚举更稳妥，因为它自带剪枝、目标下界与时间限制回调。CP-SAT 适合的类型正是装箱、调度与分配这类组合问题。</p>\n<p>层 1 的关键工程细节是<strong>给求解器设硬时间上限并保留最优可行解</strong>。不是「设了超时就放弃」，而是「超时后返回当前找到的最好可行解」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"solver = cp_model.CpSolver()&#10;solver.parameters.max_time_in_seconds = 0.15&#10;solver.parameters.num_search_workers = 4&#10;status = solver.Solve(model)&#10;if status in (cp_model.OPTIMAL, cp_model.FEASIBLE):&#10;    return extract_plan(solver, objective_value=solver.ObjectiveValue(),&#10;                        bound=solver.BestObjectiveBound())&#10;return fallback_plan()   # 层 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solver </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cp_model.CpSolver()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solver.parameters.max_time_in_seconds </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solver.parameters.num_search_workers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> solver.Solve(model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cp_model.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">OPTIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cp_model.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEASIBLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract_plan(solver, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">objective_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solver.ObjectiveValue(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                        bound</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">solver.BestObjectiveBound())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fallback_plan()   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 层 3</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>BestObjectiveBound()</code> 与 <code>ObjectiveValue()</code> 的差给出了求解质量的自我报告——这个 gap 应该被记录进决策记录（见 <a href=\"../split-factor-rule/split-rule-priority-config\">拆单规则与优先级配置</a> 中的 <code>decision_id</code>），因为它是「我们离最优还有多远」的唯一客观度量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层-2-启发式\">层 2：启发式</h3><p>规模超出层 1 时退到启发式。推荐组合是 <strong>FFD 构造 + 局部搜索改进</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>按「体积重 × 单价」降序排列行项（重且贵的先放，因为它们对分档最敏感）。</li>\n<li>依次尝试放入现有包裹：优先放能<strong>不跨费率分档</strong>的包裹，其次是<strong>同区</strong>的包裹，最后才开新包裹。</li>\n<li>对结果做局部搜索：尝试把某个小包裹合并进其他包裹（若合并后成本下降），或把某件商品从一个包裹移到另一个（若总成本下降）。移动到不再改进为止。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>局部搜索的邻域应该限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 以内，避免在大订单上耗时失控。一个常被忽略的改进方向是<strong>简化</strong>：先尝试把两个包裹合并成一个（减少包裹数），再尝试在包裹间搬运商品（降低运费）——两个方向交替进行，收敛更快。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用规模</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>CP-SAT / 枚举</td>\n<td>≤8 行项、≤4 仓</td>\n<td>最优，或带 gap 的可行解</td>\n<td>10–150 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>FFD + 局部搜索</td>\n<td>中等规模</td>\n<td>包数 ≤ 1.222·OPT + 2/3</td>\n<td>5–30 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>确定性兜底</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td><strong>仅保证可行，无质量保证</strong></td>\n<td>&lt; 5 ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"层-3-确定性兜底\">层 3：确定性兜底</h3><p>兜底解必须满足三个性质：<strong>永远可行</strong>（不依赖任何求解，纯规则）、<strong>确定</strong>（同样的输入永远给同样的输出，便于复现与对账）、<strong>快速</strong>（微秒级）。一个符合要求的兜底策略是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>把行项按「必须独立成包」的硬约束分组（特货、不同清关主体）。</li>\n<li>在每个组内，按候选仓的优先级顺序（就近、有货）贪心装满一包再开下一包。</li>\n<li>若某行项在任何仓都无库存，把它标为「待补货子单」并记录，而不是让整个方案失败。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>兜底解会成为「系统在最坏情况下仍然给出了什么」的记录，它是排查线上异常的起点：如果监控显示兜底解的比例上升，说明层 1、2 在频繁失败，需要查是数据规模暴涨还是求解器超时阈值过紧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与超时治理\">状态机与超时治理</h2><h3 id=\"求解过程的状态机\">求解过程的状态机</h3><p>拆单求解发生在下单主链路上，它的状态必须是显式可观测的，否则超时问题无法定位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; CandidateBuilding&#10;  CandidateBuilding --&gt; Prefiltering: 硬约束过滤&#10;  Prefiltering --&gt; SolvingExact: 规模小&#10;  Prefiltering --&gt; SolvingHeuristic: 规模大&#10;  SolvingExact --&gt; Solved: 找到解&#10;  SolvingExact --&gt; SolvingHeuristic: 超时&#10;  SolvingHeuristic --&gt; Solved: 可行&#10;  SolvingHeuristic --&gt; Fallback: 不可行或异常&#10;  Fallback --&gt; Solved: 兜底可行&#10;  Solved --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; CandidateBuilding\n  CandidateBuilding --&gt; Prefiltering: 硬约束过滤\n  Prefiltering --&gt; SolvingExact: 规模小\n  Prefiltering --&gt; SolvingHeuristic: 规模大\n  SolvingExact --&gt; Solved: 找到解\n  SolvingExact --&gt; SolvingHeuristic: 超时\n  SolvingHeuristic --&gt; Solved: 可行\n  SolvingHeuristic --&gt; Fallback: 不可行或异常\n  Fallback --&gt; Solved: 兜底可行\n  Solved --&gt; [*]</pre><h3 id=\"时间预算的分配\">时间预算的分配</h3><p>整个拆单链条的时间预算应该显式分配，而不是让每一段「尽量快」：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>建议预算占比</th>\n<th>超时后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>事实采集（查各仓 ATP）</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>缺数据的仓被排除，可能过度拆单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬约束过滤与候选生成</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>候选不足，退到兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>求解（层 1/2）</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>退到下一层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>落库与预留</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>不能超时，必须完成或整体回滚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是硬性的：<strong>求解可以超时，预留不能超时</strong>。原因是求解超时的代价只是「解差一点」，而预留超时的代价是「不知道货有没有扣住」，后者会直接导致超卖或重复扣减。因此预留阶段要么完整成功，要么按 <a href=\"../parent-child-consistency/parallel-reserve-merge-window\">分仓并发预留与合单窗口</a> 描述的事务边界整体回滚。</p>\n<p>一个实用的超时治理手段是<strong>快速预判可行性</strong>：在进入求解前，先用一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的检查确认「所有行项的总量能被全部候选仓的净 ATP 覆盖」。如果连这个必要条件都不满足，就不该启动求解器，直接进入缺货处理路径——这能挡掉大部分无意义的求解开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拆单优化的核心子结构是<strong>装箱问题</strong>，NP-hard，不存在多项式精确解；工程答案是<strong>分层降级链</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>FFD 的紧界 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>OPT</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11/9 \\cdot \\text{OPT} + 2/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11/9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OPT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 说明启发式在真实规模下足够好；不要为了最优性把主链路拖慢。</li>\n<li>目标含费率阶梯时结构接近<strong>多背包问题</strong>，与「容量相加的单背包」不等价；背包 DP 是伪多项式的，容量按金额编码时会膨胀。</li>\n<li>层 1 精确求解应设<strong>硬时间上限并保留最优可行解</strong>，同时记录 <code>ObjectiveValue</code> 与 <code>BestObjectiveBound</code> 的 gap。</li>\n<li>层 2 用 <strong>FFD 构造 + 合并/搬运两个方向的局部搜索</strong>，邻域限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>层 3 兜底必须<strong>永远可行、确定、微秒级</strong>，其触发比例是最重要的线上异常信号。</li>\n<li>时间预算要显式分配到各阶段，且遵循一条铁律：<strong>求解可以超时，预留不能超时</strong>。</li>\n<li>进入求解前先做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的覆盖性必要条件检查，挡掉无意义的求解开销。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拆单优化求解与降级","id":"拆单优化求解与降级"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：这是一个装箱问题，而装箱问题没有多项式精确解","id":"核心概念-这是一个装箱问题-而装箱问题没有多项式精确解"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这个问题是 NP-hard","id":"为什么这个问题是-np-hard"},{"level":3,"text":"归约关系","id":"归约关系"},{"level":3,"text":"目标里还有背包的影子","id":"目标里还有背包的影子"},{"level":2,"text":"降级链的三层设计","id":"降级链的三层设计"},{"level":3,"text":"层 1：精确求解","id":"层-1-精确求解"},{"level":3,"text":"层 2：启发式","id":"层-2-启发式"},{"level":3,"text":"层 3：确定性兜底","id":"层-3-确定性兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与超时治理","id":"状态机与超时治理"},{"level":3,"text":"求解过程的状态机","id":"求解过程的状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"时间预算的分配","id":"时间预算的分配"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运费/时效/拆单数目标权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-optimization/cost-transit-split-objective"},"next":{"title":"拆单后跨境税费/运费重算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-intelligent-split-fulfillment/split-optimization/cross-border-tax-freight-recalc"}}